        "stage": 36.5,
        "statement": "March 2019...At 36 to 37 feet...the James Kipp Recreation is under 4 to 5 feet of water. Low spots could be deeper. Main cause was an ice jam. Gauge was damaged and moved to higher ground after this incident."
      },
      {
        "stage": 29,
        "statement": "March 2019...At 29 Feet, James Kipp Recreation area starts taking on water. Boat ramps are under water. Snowmelt was the main cause."
      },
      {
        "stage": 27,
        "statement": "June 2018 - Estimated that James Kipp Campground area begins to flood."
      },
      {
        "stage": 25.4,
        "statement": "June 2018 - Boat ramp at James Kipp Campground is under water "
      }
